menu "Mosaico game loop placement"
config MOSAICO_GAME_LOOP_CPU1
    bool "Run gameplay and rendering loop on CPU1"
    depends on !FREERTOS_UNICORE
    default n
    help
        Finish startup and the first display flush on the calling task, then
        run input, fixed updates and rendering on a dedicated CPU1 task.
        The caller waits until the loop exits. Uses an additional task stack
        equal to CONFIG_ESP_MAIN_TASK_STACK_SIZE. Benchmark before enabling.
endmenu
